traint violations: 0\n- Fallback behavior on error: N/A\n- Model substitution without consent: 0\n- Process control compliance: Excellent\n\n## Suitable Tasks (evidence-backed)\n- Implementation verification (code matches plan) — existing doc\n- Regression detection — existing doc\n- Pattern compliance checking — existing doc\n- Fast triage reviews and CI gate reviews — existing doc\n- Adversarial-consensus partner to deep audit (project-completion-report §8) — evidence: consensus with gemini\n\n## Unsuitable Tasks (evidence-backed)\n- Architectural design critique — existing doc\n- Novel vulnerability discovery — existing doc\n- Design iteration / improvement suggestions — existing doc\n- Complex system reasoning — existing doc\n\n## Dependencies\n- Works well with: git diff, rg for context, cargo check; gemini-3.1-pro as the deep-audit counterpart\n\n## Supporting Evidence\n| Evidence Type | Reference | Quality |\n|---|---|---|\n| Controlled experiment | Reviewed 17 modified files | Replicated |\n| Independent reviewer agreement | Gemini 3.1 Pro audit: 0 issues | Agreement |\n| Project observation | 0 findings in production code | Observed |\n\n## Confidence Assessment\n- Level: High\n- Reviewer: evidence-gathering draft (#190)\n- Date: 2026-08-06\n- Evidence considered: existing doc + project-completion-report (2 independent records)\n- Significant changes from prior assessment: No substantive changes; corroborated by project-completion-report adversarial consensus","created_at":"2026-08-06T00:20:14.679315773Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:9DWgR7EZs9TzI+CSf9QOKPTK/LUQzXpzxo4q7qjICJw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg5WLaN76jNQ76l0zXxQ4vppVv+tVax7SoQJE69Ljij/cAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAS50lMcfIGIpb8AG+jfUR4MidXxW9MR5+mb42e9jG5cUKjkyTns4Pr5wis16bsXh8kGDBW4lQFa9lxgJoXAsyBw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:9DWgR7EZs9TzI+CSf9QOKPTK/LUQzXpzxo4q7qjICJw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkM